{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407822-newb-question-about-dotfc","id":1407822,"title":"Newb Question about DotFC","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-08-12T17:36:12-07:00","id":1407822,"title":"Newb Question about DotFC","content":"So, I want to take Terrestrial Circle Sorcery and I want to take Demon of the First Circle as my first spell. It doesn't have a control bonus so would it be my control spell? Also, what does &quot;ritual&quot; in the cost mean?<br /> <br /> Tyzerg","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T17:41:23-07:00","id":1407824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407822-newb-question-about-dotfc#post1407822\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I want to take Terrestrial Circle Sorcery and I want to take Demon of the First Circle as my first spell. It doesn't have a control bonus so would it be my control spell? Also, what does &amp;quot;ritual&amp;quot; in the cost mean?<br /> <br /> Tyzerg</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, it would still be your control spell, it just doesn\u2019t have a bonus. It\u2019s already good enough without one. Cost:Ritual means that it can\u2019t be cast in combat time, so you don\u2019t need to bother tracking sorcerous motes, as you\u2019ll definitely get enough over the length of the multi-hour ritual.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1424-ghanjrho","name":"GhanjRho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1424_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T17:52:12-07:00","id":1407826,"title":"","content":"Yes. A few very good spells do not have a control bonus, which incentivizes taking other sorcery - Swiss Army Demons and 'sorcerers' who only know Demon of the First Circle is something that was rather played out in previous editions. That said, there's nothing <i>wrong</i> with taking it as your control spell - you don't have any bonus, but if you truly have no interest in other spells it's not a bad choice for dipping your toe in.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2334-aliasi","name":"Aliasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2334_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"197"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T18:16:54-07:00","id":1407829,"title":"","content":"Okay, thanks guys. I get it now! So, probably better to take a different starter spell and just buy DotFC with bonus points or whatever.<br /> <br /> Tyzerg","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-12T18:33:33-07:00","id":1407832,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407822-newb-question-about-dotfc?p=1407829#post1407829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay, thanks guys. I get it now! So, probably better to take a different starter spell and just buy DotFC with bonus points or whatever.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you're interested in having more than one spell, ever, yes; if demonology is all you ever intend to do, then just go with that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T06:17:18-07:00","id":1407915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407822-newb-question-about-dotfc?p=1407832#post1407832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you're interested in having more than one spell, ever, yes; if demonology is all you ever intend to do, then just go with that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Got it. Making an Eclipse with control issues and a mean streak so I'll probably go with Corrupted Words as the control spell section makes it very subtle and take DotFC as my second spell. Thanks for the clarifications.<br /> <br /> Is there a &quot;take these charms if you don't want to die&quot; model in this edition like previous editions with Ox-body/Perfect Defense in 2nd and a Persistent Defense in 1st? I'm leaning heavily into socialize, presence, and larceny for this Eclipse with Dreaming Pearl being his combat route but I don't want to get one-shotted by the first Dragon-blooded he runs into that he can't seduce.<br /> <br /> Tyzerg","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T07:44:18-07:00","id":1407933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407822-newb-question-about-dotfc?p=1407915#post1407915\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is there a &quot;take these charms if you don't want to die&quot; model in this edition like previous editions with Ox-body/Perfect Defense in 2nd and a Persistent Defense in 1st?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ox-Body Technique is vastly more worthwhile in 3e than it was in 2e, but how able you are to get by without it is going to vary based on your group's playstyle.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm leaning heavily into socialize, presence, and larceny for this Eclipse with Dreaming Pearl being his combat route but I don't want to get one-shotted by the first Dragon-blooded he runs into that he can't seduce.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say the biggest thing to remember with regard to combat in Ex3 is not to rely <i>entirely</i> on one Ability to carry you through everything. If you're sincerely <i>worried </i>about getting caught in a combat, get some dots in Awareness for countering stealth, Resistance for countering poison, some Dodge for when you need to disengage or face an unblockable attack, a dot or two in Thrown or Archery for attacks at range, and some Athletics or Ride for when you need to chase a fucker down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T07:49:40-07:00","id":1407936,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407822-newb-question-about-dotfc?p=1407933#post1407933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ox-Body Technique is vastly more worthwhile in 3e than it was in 2e, but how able you are to get by without it is going to vary based on your group's playstyle.</div> </div> </div> </div> Good to know!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407822-newb-question-about-dotfc?p=1407933#post1407933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd say the biggest thing to remember with regard to combat in Ex3 is not to rely <i>entirely</i> on one Ability to carry you through everything. If you're sincerely <i>worried </i>about getting caught in a combat, get some dots in Awareness for countering stealth, Resistance for countering poison, some Dodge for when you need to disengage or face an unblockable attack, a dot or two in Thrown or Archery for attacks at range, and some Athletics or Ride for when you need to chase a fucker down.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, sounds good! I was already looking at awareness and dodge as Dreaming Pearl boosts Evade and I don't want to get surprised. Would you use Ride if you were riding an Agata, or because it's mostly intelligent you wouldn't need to like I wouldn't need ride to ride around on a Lunar?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T07:56:52-07:00","id":1407942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tyzerg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407822-newb-question-about-dotfc?p=1407936#post1407936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would you use Ride if you were riding an Agata, or because it's mostly intelligent you wouldn't need to like I wouldn't need ride to ride around on a Lunar?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ride dots will still be handy; the Agata may be bound to serve your will, but you will still need to direct it, after all, and being able to do so wordlessly might prove invaluable.<br /> <br /> \u200bPlus if you get in some rough weather and the ST calls for a Dexterity + Ride roll to stay in the saddle... &gt;.&gt;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 08-13-2020, 11:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T08:16:10-07:00","id":1407946,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407822-newb-question-about-dotfc?p=1407942#post1407942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ride dots will still be handy; the Agata may be bound to serve your will, but you will still need to direct it, after all, and being able to do so wordlessly might prove invaluable.<br /> <br /> \u200bPlus if you get in some rough weather and the ST calls for a Dexterity + Ride roll to stay in the saddle... &gt;.&gt;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's a really good point. Worth probably a couple dots then. Has anyone homebrewed that Demon that worked as living armor/surprise help yet?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3230-tyzerg","name":"Tyzerg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"131"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T08:48:46-07:00","id":1407955,"title":"","content":"Behold, a <i>lot</i> of demon updates:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15BZMrBkO8j_-XZX5030Y0_GNrCvI9JRQhN_uXR-jjsQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15BZMrBkO8j_-XZX5030Y0_GNrCvI9JRQhN_uXR-jjsQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15BZMrBkO8j_-XZX5030Y0_GNrCvI9JRQhN_uXR-jjsQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/15BZMrBkO8j_-XZX5030Y0_GNrCvI9JRQhN_uXR-jjsQ/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13313-sith_happens","name":"Sith_Happens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13313_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1177"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-13T09:42:42-07:00","id":1407964,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sith_Happens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1407822-newb-question-about-dotfc?p=1407955#post1407955\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Behold, a <i>lot</i> of demon updates:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/15BZMrBkO8j_-XZX5030Y0_GNrCvI9JRQhN_uXR-jjsQ/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thank you!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":